    "company_overview": "Maintenance Machinery Company is a company specialized in providing a wide range of equipment related to the automotive maintenance sector and accessories whose main products include the following: - Tire equipment - Brake maintenance machines - Rim repair equipment - Suspension and brake testing devices - Suspension and brake testing devices - Lighting inspection equipment - Environmental Inspection Equipment - Welding machines for cars - Petrol Station Equipment & Accessories - Fault diagnostic devices - Car and vehicle cranes - Equipment for checking and maintaining fuel cycles - Oil and grease equipment - Mechanical hand tools and accessories - Compressors and air extensions - Freon charging stations - Car painting equipment - Car chassis repair - Measuring and inspection devices - Car wash equipment - Electric vehicle equipment",
    "company_history": "A company was established in 1980, and the company is headquartered in Jeddah. The company is one of the market leaders in the field of maintenance solutions, technical services and services related to vehicle service centers in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia.The company takes an integrated approach through two main lines of business: the first concerns the sale of equipment while the second involves the provision of after-sales services. This approach ensures its customers comprehensive solutions that meet their operational needs. The company''s relationships with the brands it supplies are based on the needs of the local market.",
